## Bandit Level 2 → Level 3

**Challenge:**
The password for the next level is stored in a file called --spaces in this filename-- located in the home directory

**Solution:**
cat ./"--spaces in this filename--"

**Explanation:**
Again like the previous level since the file has a - in it we cannot run it without ./ and since it has spaces in the name we have to encapsulate it with ""

**Password:**
MNk8KNH3Usiio41PRUEoDFPqfxLPlSmx

**What I learned:**
Use "" to encapsulate files that have spaces otherwise the terminal will try to run each word as a file.
